    <comment>No recent avalanche activity in the past week. Danger: Moderate, low,low pending significant new wx. Three CT done. #1 = NR, #2 CTM19SC@104 &amp;amp; CTH30SC@83,  #3 CTM20SC@104 suspect buried suface hoar.\nModerate - strong winds SW to NW continue to scour alpine. ALP - HSL bridging over weak layers. Some SSL from sporadic snow flurries at TL. BTL unsupportive FC to ground.</comment>
